!Name: puf-orbits
!C There are several different ways ("orbits") in which
!C the smoke from one of the original puffers can stabilize
!C naturally. The numbers in {brackets} are the number of
!C cells added per period, as a way to help distinguish
!C different orbits.
!C
!C p20{0} Jason Summers, 2006.
!C p100{98} JS, 2006.
!C p100{210} Helmut Postl, 1994.
!C p100{56} Nick Gotts, 2005.
!C p140{440} Gosper, early 1970s.
!C p200{195} HP, 1994.
!C p200{359} HP, 1994.
!Source: jslife-moving
!
